1
00:00:02,127 --> 00:00:03,377
[PAINTBALLS FIRING]

2
00:00:03,753 --> 00:00:05,583
HOWARD:
That was close.

3
00:00:07,298 --> 00:00:10,428
(Raj:)God, I love the smell of paintballs
in the morning.

4
00:00:11,344 --> 00:00:12,924
(Howard:)Yeah, still funny, Raj.

5
00:00:13,763 --> 00:00:15,263
[PAINTBALLS FIRING]

6
00:00:15,849 --> 00:00:17,309
(Leonard:)No way we can get to the ridge.

7
00:00:17,475 --> 00:00:19,645
(Leonard:)The Chemistry Department
has us cut off.

8
00:00:19,811 --> 00:00:21,021
(Howard:)What about the creek bed?

9
00:00:21,187 --> 00:00:23,107
(Sheldon:)The Pharmacology Department
controls that.

10
00:00:23,273 --> 00:00:25,943
(Sheldon:)And they're all hopped up
on experimental steroids.

11
00:00:26,109 --> 00:00:27,529
(Raj:)That's it then, we're doomed.

12
00:00:27,694 --> 00:00:30,324
Time to acknowledge
that we are paying the price...

13
00:00:30,488 --> 00:00:34,288
...for some failing to attend Physics
Department paintball strategy meeting.

14
00:00:34,451 --> 00:00:37,121
(Howard:)I told you, my mom has spider veins.

15
00:00:37,287 --> 00:00:40,497
(Howard:)I had to take her to the laser clinic.

16
00:00:41,291 --> 00:00:44,671
(Sheldon:)And I told you I wanted
to see a doctor's note.

17
00:00:45,837 --> 00:00:48,677
(Raj:)We need a plan.
How about Operation Hammer of the Gods?

18
00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:50,470
(Leonard:)Which one is Hammer of the Gods?

19
00:00:50,633 --> 00:00:54,553
We hide in the parking lot
and ambush people when they come to pee.

20
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:58,640
No, the dumpsters are deep
in Astronomy Department territory.

21
00:00:58,808 --> 00:01:01,148
(Leonard:)Shouldn't be a problem,
Venus is up during the day.

